OL,3,GNEWSABlood donor's target of 100
OL,4,Aachieved by friends
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose lifelong goal was to donate
OL,7,Fblood 100 times has been honoured with
OL,8,Fa mass blood donation by friends and
OL,9,Ffamily after his unexpected death in
OL,10,FFebruary.
OL,12,FAdam Wise, from Wiltshire, was almost
OL,13,Fhalfway through his goal with 47
OL,14,Fdonations before he died aged 40.
OL,16,FHis sister Charlotte Keogh, 38, who
OL,17,Forganised the blood drive at Melksham
OL,18,FSports and Social Club on Monday, said
OL,19,Fshe was "pleased and relieved" they
OL,20,Fmanaged to give 64 donations, bringing
OL,21,Fthe total to "111 [donations] in Adam's
OL,22,Fname".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
