OL,3,GNEWSABlood donor's target of 100
OL,4,Aachieved by friends
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NHS Blood and Transplant service
OL,7,Fsaid Wise would have helped as many as
OL,8,F141 seriously ill people during his
OL,9,Flifetime.
